  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b><strong>Short Information :</strong></b>&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Commission, DSSSB</a> </span>has released the DSSSB Answer Key for the Various Recruitment 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025. DSSSB Various Post October &amp; December Exam was held on <span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>09 November To 15 December 2025</strong></span>.</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> The Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their answer key from the link given below.</span></div>\n<div class=\"post-desc\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Commission, DSSSB</span></strong></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">DSSSB MTS , Various Exam Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>01 October 2025 to 15 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer key Release Date : <strong>25 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Release Date : <strong>19 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Exam Details</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name </strong>:&nbsp;Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Recruitment 2026</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Exam Conduct&nbsp;</strong>: Delhi Subordinate&nbsp;Service Selection Board&nbsp;DSSSB Are Conducted the Various Recruitment Exam in Every&nbsp;<span id=\"IL_AD11\" class=\"IL_AD\">Year</span></span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">It is hereby informed that DSSSB has released the Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key 2026 &amp; the objection raise has also been released. Candidates may download their Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key 2026 from this page. For getting more information regarding Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key, candidates need to maintain a frequent check on the Portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">As per the official news, the organization has uploaded the Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key for the aforesaid examination has release now. Appeared candidates will be able to check and download their Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Answer Key online by using their login details, as the answer key are available on official web portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instructions For Downloading The DSSSB Various Post Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Answer Key link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new page will be opened in which candidates have to provide Roll Number / Application Number &amp; DOB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the answer key &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the answer Key also from the official website of Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Commission, DSSSB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Join Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"t